2066:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * Resets the timer count to zero, by setting CC8yTCCLR.TCC bit.\n\n
