2443:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * After this API call, XMC_CCU8_EnableShadowTransfer() has to be called with appropriate mask
2444:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * to transfer the dither value.
2445:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  *
